# Google AdSense
# 1. Create an account at https://adsense.google.com
# 2. Add this site's URL and wait for approval
# 3. Copy your Publisher ID (format: ca-pub-XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX)
# 4. Once you create ad units in AdSense, put their slot IDs into the
#    <AdSlot slot="..."> calls in src/pages/*.tsx
#
# Locally: copy this file to .env and fill in VITE_ADSENSE_CLIENT_ID below.
#
# On Vercel: Vercel blocks saving env vars with recognized "public" prefixes
# (VITE_, NEXT_PUBLIC_, etc.) unless you explicitly mark them as safe/Config.
# To avoid that friction, set the var WITHOUT the prefix instead:
#   Name:  ADSENSE_CLIENT_ID
#   Value: ca-pub-XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX
# vite.config.ts maps ADSENSE_CLIENT_ID -> import.meta.env.VITE_ADSENSE_CLIENT_ID
# at build time, so the app code doesn't need to change either way.
VITE_ADSENSE_CLIENT_ID=
